      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Notes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SeedVR2 7B upscale\n\nOne-step diffusion restoration: upscales and repairs detail without a prompt. Works on photos and on images from the other workflows.\n\n- **Load Image**: pick or upload the image. Transparency is kept.\n- **Resize Image/Mask** sets the scale (default 2x, lanczos). SeedVR2 then restores detail at that size, so time and memory grow with the output's pixel count; 4x on a 1024x1024 image is a 4096x4096 output.\n- **KSampler**: 1 step, cfg 1, denoise 1 is how the model was trained; change only the seed, which varies fine detail.\n- **SeedVR2 Post Processing**: lab matches the original's colours most closely; wavelet keeps more of the new high-frequency detail; none skips colour transfer.\n- Swap in **seedvr2_7b_sharp_int8_convrot** for crisper but harsher output, or **seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot** for speed, after adding them to models.yml.\n- The compare node slides between the input and the result. Images are saved without the prompt or workflow embedded."
      ]
    }
